      "lineNbr": 203,
      "author": {
        "id": 1019013
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-19T14:29:06Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e I was thinking if you call setFoo, where foo requires version x, then we set the version to max(x, whatever it was before).\n\nWell, I just wanted to minimize job of individual methods and also gives more flexibility. Since we have `setVersion()`, I would be surprised if version can be changed by other APIs.\n\n\u003e Do you really want set(null) to be valid?\n\nWell, `set(null)` can help to reuse builder for other purpose.\n\n\u003e Not a big deal, tbf.\n\nSo, let me ack for this.",
      "parentUuid": "705813f6_e8f33821",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 187,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 203,
        "endChar": 9
